{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1462,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc10e346222dcca1c356ecae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃…今天要做什么？\r\n我已经准备好了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "73bb5bab9162ac821b6f81738a2536232435e105ff12cfdd6ba9f03ccdd85b14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eca4f6efc981eef8c4e836c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一步一步踏实地把事情做好吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "566c39cffda9c822d37efc8a0f3bd14950ff0228655378006783ffc10c7f54b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d2941e3c06d84962d60c8fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…哈，对不起…\r\n我这样老是叹气，这不太好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1223bcbc710190e7bd6690350615c1f976487b94fc6f7dc0d45f6a0cdeab0458",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47b0831f27d7cd71ca1fc427",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔…总感觉\r\n比平时还难有成效…",
      "source_fingerprint": "433cb38d1f3046e6a48fc3dc3a1be9d3d799a0088970003658737f4f7cc1fbcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e363e7ea31616b0c1db51e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管做什么…感觉都没有成效。\r\n…果然是因为我不行吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "933aa3f4521efba9391163547c8ea43b52e257ef36cec1ba65803d461846c80a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74430073d1c30901b169f73f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起…\r\n好不容易指导我到现在，\r\n但我却拿不出什么成果…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdf976857caa12eedcc7b4c38e31d973e78c70a51b2e56ffbd66423258ef5c07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:623c48ab5ec761e1e49767c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛的经验…一定要积累很多，对吧。\r\n那…假期呢，不，没什么…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ad9bd95d63d442c6e9427c3b73e8d73bdd6450483c4fc7218cc97107faa8749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c52b6d2da1ed356dc1daf6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么呢…\r\n明明不想有“好讨厌”这种想法…\r\n明明想在比赛里拿出成绩…",
      "source_fingerprint": "898bdf7e9e1734573585bf1ee095d226660fabe518f65380e0154f238cdf7743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3815b7c0456143053f6cb78a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…嗯。\r\n这个成绩对我来说已经很不错了。\r\n…拼尽全力，然后赢下来…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64c86b0919e25599c5fd2988e45152a92aaff30119a005c3e71d393d4d2a3fed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e19137f1b6bafb59631e2114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是现在的我的话――\r\n好！训练员，\r\n我要上了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcfd4dcca2801a21a444fc1e08a33e0adab5ea01b1ddf85b22babc05f64bd0d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa36fbcd2fd040c679152e25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是现在这种状态…\r\n感觉…我能拿到最好的…成果出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "558214d1ec0f2f73544c7021751c9f8d8fb9fe49d9bbcbb92717237d10516463",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a135f6017246ad6fa947720",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "进行过各种各样的训练…\r\n那么接下来，只需要信任它们，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54fb82b1867e068d67af81daa4253d816bfa963e34eef4e9834a4bcf6b676a93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97c8e2092fff2715fb243124",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想…再来最后一次作战会议，\r\n因为在最后时刻我想全力以赴…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "281b40af2399ac6c2bec28b1460161f51f463de9f674c0c1ec04996f9a5d06b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89d1f044744f5562d462ed7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应该稍微变强了点…\r\n所以，一定…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "572e9a75f94bd74f21ea2fa02dafd6a245404b4ecfe5e49e181cefb7e7d97bf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a54851e7c58243fb211837a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平常心、平常心…\r\n快回想训练的时候…",
      "source_fingerprint": "51789cf3a0b01a3ed95caca57a745c3cd88266ba48c2f22f921afb32af762ac8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa550804ba55c01a41219b08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "问我状态吗…？\r\n总之…我感觉还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b707164d69e44eafeef70a146c5448d7be3a5d9b4f69a8c5a8851bfb2dc1cbe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb3de035fb9cc239df643ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能做的都做了…\r\n如果能拿出点成果来的话…",
      "source_fingerprint": "a103237d56d86820733ac122e8458b3ad98297c1be759853a633a9481d052925",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcb826a11945f2759c62a463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家看起来都好强…\r\n我就像是在借用大家的力量一样…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f369ac909f988c6d68833c1db0905c170a98d559d926a97da2df7ad87f511c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1831711913fff88595ccaa4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉状态不太好…\r\n但是，结果还没出来，\r\n胜负还未见分晓…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc7c140a4cc29cd4ed1a4a5304646e423c760a56e6bbfcc4a568c0ebe05ed81b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9f59656bf1e4938302a8e01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态…那个、不好、不过。\r\n不过就算是这样，我也会尽力…\r\n做到最好…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c5768340efba04ce8293b32ef0af119b06eb5cacd81b299b75d0f45e2e47d49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e376ebc4d4de167ecf94ce3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "至少，现在能做到的…\r\n希望能跑到最后…",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9922be8bde7a84ab3defc2429f1ba3d9e358c732052c5a274801152ed4ad43d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50630b4ce04c5496b87d984e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然离做到最好还有一段距离…\r\n但是，至少我会留下一些痕迹的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c0f26fabc6f0b4c0805b9e53f4e68166b7268b2ae356e1126e14769465d48e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0eadaaaec02d591392947c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………呃？\r\n对…对不起。\r\n在想心事…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8727200e87091275aa146409ee31e9d801e219471fdc44c0de67ca9a6260c384",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad42bb8c2de89a710b51de95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e831f3cece677ab4906aafc81224d18a698e0c31839e08bd8677263fb4452c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80af90a480a1f83faa57c96e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再往前一点…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af72343c95acd64f1e88cce55e66032f97e88d7d484e2ff0e69ce2ed5fd70c08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da4743c1137eb16743544e16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee82cb89791e8fd7c131f2ba71bcbff47d462ee7f3cd80c08e8893a573ac35d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51c58033426699a121a33b88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e10b7570d9e899b17fa0512f64cc66a4b929600cbbcb9bbfed8dabba6d9aba6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41b5d9fffbe386abf0113891",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这？",
      "source_fingerprint": "12dd2e8e153f68fdf98356b1b68727cd10af0fa1b83b121ae9ffa25cd2c0d0ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07057507bb5a5017523805b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔…",
      "source_fingerprint": "68c41674d06f7c8f951c8dd8053e068e6d4787983cd314eada5e0bbc760b01d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f5d4fe0791165a20c611fda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19d28a899f5f452a4e9ed85188b39df2d3bcb00ac6d934b0813c7c6d14f8a09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeac84eac1834fb47bc629a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d7b0d351354d6ea26eb26e88fd8b16593bbeb149b243b2bbad7c4c116d52127",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:043a61e14991c8040e744ae5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果只有我一个人的话，\r\n应该是到不了这里的…",
      "source_fingerprint": "93b113ead3a137551cc5726d1522836d7dba452f95c66693fca75c9f108a34ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77fbd7c66f9dfff3a2cfbf2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感、感谢指导…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9a436b51d98230f9855250b0bde3f97a4b259500b3d2bd2f3a1b0b1d558694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd3ba15c64b88fd291b78e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぼ、僕ですか…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90779cd41acf61c48e6032bf79f49bd7b0e669885229728acd7a7900fa4a51f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:005ef02b057d55a57f5b4ae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会拖后腿的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb254e1bb8119d4290baf4aea32a2841b65d9c170eba36e5e66c0ea70c36531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95b09e9709571cdfc9beb1f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个…请加油～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9bd14e19b223222fe426dcfe18a2d18f7ba20b15c23323a940459eac90b956b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c603bb51e265d72d8cc70c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感、感谢指导…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9a436b51d98230f9855250b0bde3f97a4b259500b3d2bd2f3a1b0b1d558694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:605b08d94d5c6c9dda9c4537",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应该稍微变强了点…\r\n所以，一定…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "572e9a75f94bd74f21ea2fa02dafd6a245404b4ecfe5e49e181cefb7e7d97bf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ed7c5088847a125220b1436",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是现在这种状态…\r\n现在这个最佳状态，应该能做到。\r\n不过，结果好像是…做到了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc7f72cad6f41b25d8783428935a4c7a04cd649864a5d8c48e9e3c8cef2c1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a6a34d830214e8fff17d5f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感、感谢指导…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9a436b51d98230f9855250b0bde3f97a4b259500b3d2bd2f3a1b0b1d558694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46981e7a5d4508ead6666081",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるぞ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0719590def11f6196a343b633667ad52bdf4f06ecaa1a326c4421f4075b5f86b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8e83740fb925e25ccc4f483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶…下一次，我…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf3f85693cbd3977cf6987370595d93547541c3c133f8db4577848fe9e00fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3995db941884581ae7a812c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没能结束吗…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f93c2808ed5786bcefc49a773d2c8e626c1dbc4aa43bf5769098e8c2eaca4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89be128a6317b3ababb773b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，还要更努力才行…",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeaf2e5b28357e496d2bbb316fa413bc37bde0206bde4627e0a98a7ba24a7d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c61f1cb0fdb40624c71be9b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离大家…好遥远…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b7f9cfc8703af44698003086190aece84cd25cffe23ac878a21a3fdfc42ea4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:895785d50c0bc6c5c8170b3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不是其他人…而是我吗！\r\n是我赢了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23e9a69f6ac26ea52897f40cf2a33e2dc70d7c4075ca0c053dd9688dda830066",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6388bdd61d3c694ac5a0abe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天可以稍微自信一点吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e6c8aba0597e0f28d7596c0c6a706d1940db13ccdabeab1919f47db8ba513b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f5775e8abb52c7a68753022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我要上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aa283f9f9e059522332f593cafda7154e2645aa9206a3a2159f7dc7cfe8122a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e85486c74e90a801b130cc53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要得到大家的认可…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57c27a567c280cfaa8afb1df91c3f9bd0dc19156e783295191cfee39ec9d55b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caee52a1a9193241ac425f1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里餐厅的“酥脆炸鸡配梅子酱”……\n好好吃啊……  如果再点一份，\n会不会不太礼貌啊……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "171849ce0696637a2993d10b6cd73f5d16e1a14e2903a17eb8a5478b454b8b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a5511c22d7e2be237e5cf1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有可以出海钓鱼的方案啊……  \n自由活动时间好想去试试……嗯？  \n居、居然能钓到金枪鱼……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "48dc0ed86fab4cf0dd9c1de025fb7bba2c2a03351dc46ed0a296fe30900fd4d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:707e3be56476e4496c429aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素质同学她们的演唱会好厉害，\r\n各自都有被爱的原因，那…我――",
      "source_fingerprint": "264950e66a0e21f680ffa79b606f331331eab285c0500076f0d2e92e276596f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49584595cad258d7913c49ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果……买了那种大胆款式的泳衣的话……\n不，不行，我肯定不适合！\n等我再有点自信……果然还是不行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76209cd14bd0d27864c6a0c1f38543d9fb8a52f43a190c04693b27649fb7e02e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:694bfe5d599ea6045ad8b1a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是我――…即便是我――…纵使是我――…\r\n哪怕是我――…！也想成为“伟大的赛马娘”…！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7806b338d05aea6ea67c4c6595ba4c673855cdad8d9afe8c47a5e5230f92dcaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1e71ea3dfab04a198213e85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是这样的我，\r\n也有人在支持我…虽然还没有自信…\r\n但是，我想要…回应这份支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "340655319283a33bcb2a70affebb471bb1891bfd16493dff0ad599a44bd5f322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f73232852f4ad511d5c093b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，冷静下来…只要按照平时训练那样做――",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb154801cab81b5172eeb464b466f5631aa140fa7b90fa2cf8a5c60273e06ffe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1965b8cda990d18ff24cebed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "炒热气氛这种事情…我也能做到吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6c916aa233f0eaa559bc0db7b84fc76401b5c151bf525b41421b77d0b64a697",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a760b2e657ad058cd2f3f54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天\r\n我会成为“伟大的赛马娘”的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de7505d317fc145269988aed6a2093081d9295d9c80e8f7ce1077967f498dce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1634da31335dc59df5cc11c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还没有足够的自信。\r\n但，但是…我信任\r\n相信着我的你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6663ce91141d417fb01e885a55a5afac040d2d83d1a5e4c8e9fde73e71b4fe53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89fcfb0575246156b3be039a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我居然也是学校的一员…\r\n现在看来也跟骗人似的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4c2226c2c019bb2253950d872dc9766029db4fa5bfcb96e7df5625c079c66cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0693e6d63ee613770dc481a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，能被人看见好多，好羞耻…",
      "source_fingerprint": "66edef7ddcf0531e2c33bcc8f436bdb1dd207e07745492565d37e15d0cdda340",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:009daee3cdb4044c917920b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要变得更强…\r\n想要更配得上这身决胜服…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b67920efead273ee889caf0d78717fc14dcb70c7d368ef82e96d80034e9dac95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdd1a0307a0e71c2969973d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "熨衣服的技术…多少进步一点了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec654cfcc3e9052bfb5fef990cc6410bfa00f7ab59e14ac375421b616a5a5217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096c9b7eaa980d11370d0882",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上唱歌还不太习惯…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3edbff5ef5942e24fc9c80bd9dcc0ce62e1bc57a72853e426fdaf52242c628b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3754bb4f96943cc2fb6cd232",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～…堂堂正正，堂堂正正地…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28af9c27e677477fdd68fb1371e860351d0f41d8d3151dc61111e6449187ee9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a82113282c9debd0bfcd91ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得奇怪就好…",
      "source_fingerprint": "09d2c8a6ee4f42c506b2c1aa144684556c708cc13b935b73efd79f876d74f18d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7b82c41391fdae1ea183bb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也会有这种情况…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8606d33a33f8f76a3bc4da27d3c6c969ff4fa2c259fb4f253a68f13b896cd85f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82bc7aab90f61881395e7c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我居然也是学校的一员…\r\n现在看来也跟骗人似的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4c2226c2c019bb2253950d872dc9766029db4fa5bfcb96e7df5625c079c66cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd925bb50fd69f2b8fcd25ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，能被看见好多…好害羞…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acd8cced5eeb9d80ba5a8b5e728c0d4e647b20e6fb4858d4a29b24ce1a4de57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ae37e3d26118efb6531c7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要变得更强…\r\n想要更配得上决胜服…",
      "source_fingerprint": "47acb489a74a6ecda10b96b857d5948d9ed2f47080f613df496d025332980f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26215d2c09237e69b2c73946",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "熨衣服的技术…多少进步一点了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec654cfcc3e9052bfb5fef990cc6410bfa00f7ab59e14ac375421b616a5a5217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a23207d1890e5250221fd28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上唱歌还不太习惯…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3edbff5ef5942e24fc9c80bd9dcc0ce62e1bc57a72853e426fdaf52242c628b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b974c9d29266d7fe4df272d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～…堂堂正正，堂堂正正地…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28af9c27e677477fdd68fb1371e860351d0f41d8d3151dc61111e6449187ee9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55b1567a9f2f1cc31f9b66fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得奇怪就好…",
      "source_fingerprint": "09d2c8a6ee4f42c506b2c1aa144684556c708cc13b935b73efd79f876d74f18d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3904b6ad362d4e4c345c7b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也会有这种情况…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8606d33a33f8f76a3bc4da27d3c6c969ff4fa2c259fb4f253a68f13b896cd85f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73cc267e7122ed71bb4325ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df01281aeb636ff58c0e666f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。\r\n那个，额…呃…\r\n啊…这个早上真好啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "025365611a01018b55891b04855b0c50b5d7489caecec0c25dec03ae069e0e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:975b86c904e345dd762ab72a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在想听一下训练计划，\r\n可以吗？…那个，想要现在\r\n多少脑袋里先有个印象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40ae465db6bb16f9abdee1db65738c622aca7749b1bb6cd20a7822f775ae8fb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2066a611413f7178713597a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上课时的内容全部卸下来的话，\r\n笔记本不够用啊…\r\n大家都是怎么解决的呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2057b25db764e2af9c02a7d7e3ce9195e222b6e8ee9f52644aa50eb11fa4a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cef9ad81526dff9ae7b6df9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，午休的时候\r\n想检查一下跑步的姿势…\r\n可以跟我一起看录像吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "35b8dcd3468a1dca83ebcca65442fb4ea1494a7c282e873a98137dc41544f85d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "90003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
